rows.54:07c4:
...So you think it exists, {a}.
That's good.
No matter how hard I try when I tell my story, I can't get the subtle nuances across to someone who doesn't believe in past lives.{p}

rows.54:0ca4:
While we're inside our mother's body, we're gently wrapped in a fluid like lukewarm water.
And we sense the world outside through our mother.
What I could always hear was the warm heartbeat, thump... thump... and my gentle mother's voice talking to me...{p}

rows.54:1924:
I felt as though a horrible, squelching crunch echoed deep in my ears.
Yes, I really shouldn't have been close enough to actually hear it.
After all, the athletic field lay between the school gate where I stood and the school building...{p}

rows.54:20e8:
Just as the rumors said, not a single blade of grass was growing in the flowerbed.
I wondered whether the spot where the soil was slightly darkened was the trace of my brother's blood.
I quietly knelt before it and closed my eyes.{p}

rows.54:2188:
Remembering my brother as he was...
Then, all of a sudden, I sensed something above my head!
If you asked me what it was, I couldn't really tell you...{p}

rows.54:238c:
When I happened to check the time, it was the time my brother and I always used to meet.
In other words... the time my brother died.
It bothered me, so the next day I went to the flowerbed at the same time.{p}

rows.54:244c:
And sure enough, my brother appeared.
With a look of surprise on his face, my brother fell headfirst...
Even now, decades after he died, my brother was reliving the moment of his death almost every day.{p}

rows.54:251c:
They say spirits that don't know they've died repeat the same thing over and over.
I think my brother probably didn't know he was dead.
But to die again and again like that... it's just too sad.{p}

rows.54:2f04:
Three moles in a row on the left hand were her trademark, you see.
Well, well... so even after reincarnation, distinguishing features like moles that serve as a mark still remain.
It's just like the mark of Cain, isn't it?{p}

rows.54:30a4:
You're scared of me?
Of course, you're the reincarnation of the one who killed my most precious brother.
You're afraid I'll take my revenge on you, aren't you?{p}

rows.54:3130:
...That's right.
No matter how much I hate you, I could never hate you enough.
Yes, if I had my way, I'd kill you in the most brutal way imaginable...{p}
